abstract: "Retained source records, constructed diagnostic inputs, saved model replies, verification scripts and manuscript sources for an audit of how public tariff exclusion rulings become model inputs. The package separates input selection, interpretation and interface behaviour, and recomputes every reported count from frozen artifacts. Coding was produced with AI assistance and has no independent expert validation."
keywords:
  - legal AI evaluation
  - evidence audit
  - tariff exclusions
  - customs rulings
  - reproducibility
  - source provenance
